### Health check

GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Root

GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json

### Redis health check (Round-trip test)

GET {{host}}/health/redis
Accept: application/json

### Users module health

GET {{host}}/api/users/health
Accept: application/json

### Auth module health

GET {{host}}/api/auth/health
Accept: application/json

### Refresh session (refresh token is read only from the HttpOnly cookie)

POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json

### Logout is anonymous and idempotent (cookie-only refresh token)

POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Accept: application/json

### Logout every session (requires a current access token)

POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List pending teachers (AdminOnly)

GET {{host}}/api/admin/teachers?status=Pending&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Approve a pending teacher (AdminOnly)

POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Reject a pending teacher (AdminOnly)

POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Disable an active user (AdminOnly)

POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Trace status changes for a user (AdminOnly)

GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit-logs?targetUserId={{userId}}&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
